1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,987
November 8, 2026. Diwali night. Samayapuram, Tiruchirappalli.

2
00:00:03,037 --> 00:00:04,950
The whole town was full of firecracker noise.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,544
That night, two 17-year-old boys went to a hospital to see a friend burned by firecrackers.

4
00:00:12,594 --> 00:00:17,228
Right next to that hospital, they had no idea their lives were about to end.

5
00:00:17,278 --> 00:00:21,279
That night, the police had no lead on who killed them.

6
00:00:21,329 --> 00:00:29,190
But in just three days, six people were arrested. One of them was brought back from Thoothukudi, 300 km away.

7
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:33,810
How? And the bigger part is what happened the next midnight.

8
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:34,950
Watch till the end.

9
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:52,953
One important thing. This case is still under police investigation, and there is no verdict.

10
00:00:53,003 --> 00:00:56,062
Everyone arrested is only an accused.

11
00:00:56,112 --> 00:00:59,782
I am only telling what the police side said and what the news reported.

12
00:00:59,832 --> 00:01:02,614
In some places the reports differ, and I will tell you that too.

13
00:01:02,664 --> 00:01:06,168
Two boys died. I respect their families' pain.

14
00:01:06,218 --> 00:01:09,000
All pictures in this video are illustrated depictions.

15
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:13,696
The two who died were Rahul and Vishal. Both were 17.

16
00:01:13,746 --> 00:01:16,650
They were relatives. They lived by doing daily-wage work.

17
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:21,819
Rahul had lost his parents. He was staying at a relative's house in Inam Samayapuram.

18
00:01:21,869 --> 00:01:24,219
Vishal was the son of Raja, from the same town.

19
00:01:24,269 --> 00:01:29,942
The spot was the Pullambadi canal bank near the Samayapuram toll plaza.

20
00:01:29,992 --> 00:01:33,203
Right beside it is a big medical college hospital.

21
00:01:33,253 --> 00:01:35,849
That hospital is where this story begins.

22
00:01:36,349 --> 00:01:43,817
In that hospital, a friend named Vignesh was being treated for burns from Diwali firecrackers.

23
00:01:43,867 --> 00:01:47,800
Rahul, Vishal and six other friends went to see him.

24
00:01:47,850 --> 00:01:55,767
While returning after the visit, about 80 metres from the hospital, an argument began.

25
00:01:55,817 --> 00:01:57,823
It was around 11:30 at night.

26
00:01:57,873 --> 00:02:04,891
News reports say a gang then arrived and attacked Rahul and Vishal with sickle-like weapons.

27
00:02:04,941 --> 00:02:08,360
Passersby were the ones who informed the police.

28
00:02:08,410 --> 00:02:12,793
When Inspector Gunasekaran rushed there, Vishal was already dead.

29
00:02:12,843 --> 00:02:15,363
Rahul was very badly wounded.

30
00:02:15,413 --> 00:02:19,668
He died on the way to the hospital.

31
00:02:19,718 --> 00:02:26,093
Two boys who went to visit a friend in hospital lost their lives right near the hospital.

32
00:02:26,143 --> 00:02:27,699
This is the pain of this case.

33
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,500
So, why did this happen?

34
00:02:29,550 --> 00:02:37,377
The Tiruchirappalli Superintendent of Police said Rahul had a personal grudge with one of the arrested over a small matter.

35
00:02:37,427 --> 00:02:40,641
The initial investigation says that is the reason for the murder.

36
00:02:40,691 --> 00:02:45,367
But the news agency ANI and some Tamil media tell a different side.

37
00:02:45,417 --> 00:02:52,007
It was reported that the police said there was a feud over a girl between Rahul and one of the arrested, named Keni.

38
00:02:52,057 --> 00:02:56,339
One Tamil report also says some people had teased a girl from the area.

39
00:02:56,389 --> 00:02:59,153
So is the reason one, two, or are both the same thing?

40
00:02:59,203 --> 00:03:03,148
There is still no firm answer. This is only the initial stage of the investigation.

41
00:03:03,198 --> 00:03:06,355
So please do not spread speculation about the boys who died.

42
00:03:06,405 --> 00:03:08,549
Only the court can say what is true.

43
00:03:09,049 --> 00:03:12,025
Now let us come to the interesting part of this case.

44
00:03:12,075 --> 00:03:14,507
Midnight. Hardly any witnesses.

45
00:03:14,557 --> 00:03:17,109
The police did not know who the killers were.

46
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:20,498
In that situation, they caught six people in just three days.

47
00:03:20,548 --> 00:03:24,190
And one was hiding 300 km away.

48
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:26,913
What would the police's first lead have been?

49
00:03:26,963 --> 00:03:29,395
A witness, a camera, or a phone?

50
00:03:29,445 --> 00:03:32,299
Tell your guess in the comments, and watch on.

51
00:03:32,799 --> 00:03:36,734
The answer is the camera. CCTV. First, Rahul's brother filed a complaint.

52
00:03:36,784 --> 00:03:40,166
It was registered at Samayapuram police station as Crime No. 386.

53
00:03:40,216 --> 00:03:44,518
Immediately, Tiruchirappalli SP Dongre Praveen Umesh formed three special teams.

54
00:03:44,568 --> 00:03:49,177
Those three teams combed through the CCTV recordings from the area.

55
00:03:49,227 --> 00:03:54,816
Police say they identified the suspects from the faces seen there.

56
00:03:54,866 --> 00:03:58,801
Among them, they identified one named Sivanesan as the main accused.

57
00:03:58,851 --> 00:04:03,214
But he was not in Tiruchirappalli. They learned he had gone to Thoothukudi.

58
00:04:03,264 --> 00:04:10,018
About 300 km away. The special team went there, found him, and brought him back to Tiruchirappalli.

59
00:04:10,068 --> 00:04:13,757
In the end, six people were arrested. Sivanesan is 21.

60
00:04:13,807 --> 00:04:17,251
Keni is 19. Saravanan is 18. Kirubakaran is 19.

61
00:04:17,301 --> 00:04:20,561
Hariharan is 22. Another one is 20 years old.

62
00:04:20,611 --> 00:04:24,055
His name differs between reports as Renison and Karanison.

63
00:04:24,105 --> 00:04:27,794
Six young men between 18 and 22.

64
00:04:27,844 --> 00:04:35,149
Note this: however far they ran, what gave them away was a camera at the very place they fled from.

65
00:04:35,649 --> 00:04:40,758
But the story does not end here. After the arrests, another big incident happened one midnight.

66
00:04:40,808 --> 00:04:45,382
Tuesday night, November 10. The weapons used in the murder had to be recovered.

67
00:04:45,432 --> 00:04:49,770
For that, police took Sivanesan to the very spot of the incident.

68
00:04:49,820 --> 00:04:54,691
This is what the police side says. There he suddenly picked up stones and threw them at the police.

69
00:04:54,741 --> 00:04:59,493
A constable named Mohan was injured. The police vehicle's window glass cracked.

70
00:04:59,543 --> 00:05:04,296
One report also says he tried to attack with a weapon he had hidden.

71
00:05:04,346 --> 00:05:08,683
Even after a warning he did not stop. So Inspector Gunasekaran fired his gun.

72
00:05:08,733 --> 00:05:11,351
The bullet hit his left knee.

73
00:05:11,401 --> 00:05:15,798
The police say they fired in self-defence and to stop him from escaping.

74
00:05:15,848 --> 00:05:23,802
The injured constable and Sivanesan were taken first to Srirangam Government Hospital, then to Tiruchirappalli Government Hospital.

75
00:05:23,852 --> 00:05:27,478
The SP went straight there to see them. This is the police side's account.

76
00:05:27,528 --> 00:05:31,154
For such incidents there are separate inquiry procedures.

77
00:05:31,204 --> 00:05:33,999
We do not know how that will end.

78
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:38,804
So what is still unanswered? First, the real reason.

79
00:05:38,854 --> 00:05:42,744
A personal grudge, a matter involving a girl, or both?

80
00:05:42,794 --> 00:05:50,071
Each report says it differently. Next, which of the six attacked first, and what was each one's role?

81
00:05:50,121 --> 00:05:55,600
This is not in the news. There is also no clear answer on whether the weapons were recovered, and what they were.

82
00:05:55,650 --> 00:06:00,784
Finally, when the chargesheet will be filed and under which sections.

83
00:06:00,834 --> 00:06:08,250
All of this will come out in court. Until then, everyone arrested is only an accused.

84
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:11,087
One thing is clear in this case.

85
00:06:11,137 --> 00:06:17,055
Even if you commit a crime and run 300 km away, one camera is enough to be caught in three days.

86
00:06:17,105 --> 00:06:22,963
But there is another side too. Two 17-year-old boys who went to see a friend did not come back.

87
00:06:23,013 --> 00:06:27,320
Six young men aged 18 to 22 are now in jail.

88
00:06:27,370 --> 00:06:30,304
Two families have lost their children.

89
00:06:30,354 --> 00:06:34,899
Anger, enmity, young violence. All of this must be settled by talking, at the very beginning.

90
00:06:34,949 --> 00:06:39,017
Otherwise, everyone only loses. Write your opinion in the comments.

91
00:06:39,067 --> 00:06:42,657
If you liked the video, like it and subscribe to the channel.

92
00:06:42,707 --> 00:06:45,641
If anything new comes out, I will tell it in the next part.

93
00:06:45,691 --> 00:06:46,000
Thank you.

